# Dev (`npm run dev`): leave VITE_API_URL unset.
# The Vite server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:3000, so the PWA at
# http://127.0.0.1:5173 (and a phone on the same Wi-Fi) does not need CORS.
#
# Production build: set the public API origin, without a trailing slash.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# If you set an absolute URL in dev, the API must allow that page origin
# (localhost:5173 and 127.0.0.1:5173 are already in the API default list).
# A phone using http://<lan-ip>:5173 plus an absolute API URL also needs
# that origin in CORS_ORIGINS. Prefer the proxy above for local testing.
